      "commit_message": "`skills-checks.yml` calls a deleted `amd/skills` reusable workflow,\ncausing every run to fail before creating jobs.\n\n- **Remove obsolete gate:** Delete the workflow, including its stale\nfederation documentation link.\n- **Preserve skill validation:** Leave the existing `skill-evals.yml`\nskillscope workflow and local evaluation dataset unchanged.\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n- Fixes #1056\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: gabeweisz <162640284+gabeweisz@users.noreply.github.com>",
